{"id":"9f201f4b2a4f3c33","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-p-name-support.md","title":"ZFC P Name Support","display":"df-zfc-p-name-support — ZFC P Name Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-p-name-support","aliases":["58-df-zfc-p-name-support"],"display":"df-zfc-p-name-support — ZFC P Name Support","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-support]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-p-name-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-p-name-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-p-name-support — ZFC P Name Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"edc520f758b19264\" href=\"?note=edc520f758b19264\" title=\"58-df-support\">58-df-support</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"754c7d946466c30d\" href=\"?note=754c7d946466c30d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support\">58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in M\">\\(P\\in M\\)</span> (forcing-poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in M^P\">\\(\\sigma\\in M^P\\)</span> (forcing name, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq P\">\\(T\\subseteq P\\)</span> (hereditary condition support)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S\\)</span> (canonical name-support predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"754c7d946466c30d\" href=\"?note=754c7d946466c30d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support\">58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameSupport}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameSupport}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}p\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{NameSupport}_S(T,\\sigma,M,P) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(T,\\sigma,M,P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}p\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{NameSupport}_S(T,\\sigma,M,P) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(T,\\sigma,M,P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate takes the transitive closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\sigma\\}\">\\(\\{\\sigma\\}\\)</span>, so conditions occurring in subnames are included.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"re